Please check the following chapter text against the chapter outline for alignment and provide actionable revision suggestions.

## Input Boundary
- This task only evaluates whether the text covers the chapter's given chapter goal, main plot progression points, subplot progression points, outline beats, and "must achieve" items from the chapter plan.
- Does not evaluate book-wide POV ratio, genre rules, macro phase, global character allocation, style quality, or rhetorical density; unless they directly cause the following chapter goals or planned outcomes to not occur.

## Chapter Outline
- Chapter {{ chapter_outline.chapter_number }}: {{ chapter_outline.title }}
- Chapter Goal: {{ chapter_outline.goal }}
{% if chapter_outline.main_plot_points %}
- Main Plot Progression Points: {{ chapter_outline.main_plot_points | join("; ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if chapter_outline.subplot_points %}
- Subplot Progression Points: {{ chapter_outline.subplot_points | join("; ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if chapter_outline.beats_summary %}
- Outline Beats (must verify each against the text when scoring):
{% for beat in chapter_outline.beats_summary %}
  {{ loop.index }}. {{ beat }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Chapter Plan
